{
  "job_B15.8.597_20251003_114347": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is synd \u00fea land gem\u00e6r into Widiandune. \u00c6rest of anna forda innan tilno\u00fe andlang tilno\u00fees to waclescumbe. Betweoh wacles cumbe & ealdan sl\u00e6de innan m\u00e6nanlea. Fram m\u00e6nanlea on horsweg. Of horswege innan gatanstige, \u00feanon innon denebroc. Of denebroce innon tilno\u00fe andlong tilno\u00fees to halgan wyllan. Of \u00fe\u00e6re wyllan in hreodcumb \u00f0anon in \u00fea m\u00e6rdic andlang \u00fe\u00e6re dic to cnictes ferwege. Of \u00feam wege on ealdan stanwege, of stanwege on posecumbes heafdon. And swa on su\u00f0 healf \u00fe\u00e6s mores to wohan \u00e6c. From \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6c \u00feurh \u00feone sceagan on flod leah \u00feanon on beamweg. From \u00feam weg on buccan sl\u00e6d & swa eft on beanweg. Andlang \u00f0\u00e6s weges to colesburnan forda, from \u00feam forda innon cyrnea. Andlang ea to m\u00e6rcumbe, lang cumbes to lind ofres heafdan. And swa to \u00feam fulanwege to nataleahes \u00e6sce, fram \u00feam \u00e6sce to duddan heale. Fram \u00feam heale andlang m\u00e6rweges to byrcsies heale, & swa to pican stapele. Of \u00feam stapule in catteshlinc, fram \u00feam hlince innan m\u00e6rbroc. Andlang broces to m\u00e6rforda, of \u00feam forda to sceapan \u00e6cge. And swa on \u00feone grenanweg, andlang weges to weallehes wege. And \u00feanon on stanihtan weg to alre wyllan, of alre wyllan to \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan dic. Andlang dic ofer huniburnan in \u00fea o\u00fere ealdan dic. And swa in \u00feone mylen pol,",
